### D. Fill in the Blanks

Students complete missing words in sentences or passages.

### E. True or False

Students identify whether statements are correct.

### F. Word Ordering

Students arrange words into a grammatically correct sentence.

### G. Sentence Ordering

Students arrange sentences or paragraphs in the correct order.

### H. Categorization

Students drag items into correct categories.

### I. Image-Based Questions

Students answer questions based on an image.

### J. Listening Exercises

- Audio playback.
- Listening comprehension.
- Questions linked to the audio.
- Optional repeat limits.

### K. Reading Comprehension

- Reading passage.
- Vocabulary support.
- Comprehension questions.
- Mixed question types.

### L. Short Answer

Students enter their own answers.

Support teacher grading and automated grading only where answers can be reliably evaluated.

### M. Long Answer

Students write detailed responses.

Teachers can manually grade them with a rubric.

### N. Translation Exercises

Translate:

- Uzbek to English.
- English to Uzbek.
- Other enabled language pairs.

### O. Vocabulary Practice

- Word and definition.
- Flashcards.
- Spaced review.
- Matching.
- Contextual use.

### P. Speaking Practice

- Record voice answers with explicit microphone permission.
- Allow teacher review.
- Store recordings securely.

### Q. Pronunciation Practice

